{
  "about": "The game's recordings that are published, one row a file in tests/recordings/files/ (order RP-01, section 7). A file goes in only by the orchestrator, after the check its row names has shown it to be what this repository's code makes of a clip that tests/recordings/make-inputs.mjs makes, and after its header was read with tests/recordings/inspect.mjs: exactly a 44-byte header and its samples, the game's file byte for byte. Only Sets H, I, M and O can have rows. The suite recordings (tests/recordings.verify.mjs) holds every row to this frame and to the folder. Seven files are published (2026-11-13); every sample of each is either compared by its check or zero (the order's section 16).",
