    "kind": "decoded voice (the game's voice_decompressed.wav) or capture (its voice_micdata.wav)",
    "input": "{ script, sha256 }: the script of this repository that makes the clip the game was fed, and that clip's SHA-256",
    "made_with": "{ game, bits, codec, voice_maxgain, other }: the game, 64 or 32, the codec, voice_maxgain, and any other setting that was changed (an object, empty if none)",
    "format": "{ rate, channels, bits, samples }",
    "bytes": "the file's length: 44 plus two a sample",
    "sha256": "the file's SHA-256, 64 lowercase hex digits",
    "pcm_sha256": "the SHA-256 of the bytes of its data chunk",
    "check": "{ name, options, files, lag, compared, equal, largest, apart }: the check of tests/reproduce.mjs that showed the file is the repository's output (celt, gain, speex or inputs), its options, its files ('this', 'input', or another row's name), the lag in samples, the samples it compared and found equal, the largest difference in 16-bit steps, and what it left out",
    "findings": "the record's findings the file bears on, by number",
    "used_by": "the files of this repository that read it"
  },
